Arrows: :math:`a \rightarrow b`, :math:`a \leftarrow b`,
:math:`a \leftarrow > b`, :math:`a \mapsto b`,
:math:`a \rightarrowtail b`, :math:`a \twoheadrightarrow b`.

Long arrows: :math:`a \longrightarrow b`, :math:`a \longleftarrow b`,
:math:`a \longleftrightarrow b`, :math:`a \Longrightarrow b`,
:math:`a \Longleftarrow b`, :math:`a \Longleftrightarrow b`.

Order: :math:`a \ll b`, :math:`a \lll b`, :math:`a \gg b`,
:math:`a \ggg b`.

Definitions: :math:`a ≔ b`, :math:`a ::= b`, :math:`a ≕ b`.

Relations: :math:`a \neq b`, :math:`a \leq b`, :math:`a \geq b`,
:math:`a \sim b`.

Fences: :math:`⟦a⟧` and :math:`\left\| a \right\|`.
